# Transcript ingest capability — gates POST /internal/transcripts on the Tool
# Layer. Loaded ONLY by the `tools` and `scribe` services (compose env_file).
# Copy to .env.ingest (gitignored) and fill in. At least 32 bytes:
#
#   openssl rand -hex 32
#
# The harness/app must NEVER hold this value; it cannot write transcripts.
RELAY_INGEST_CAPABILITY=
